<title>DENMARK: SOCCER-DANISH SUPER LEAGUE RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DANISH SUPER LEAGUE RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of soccer matches</p>
<p>played in the Danish super league during the last weekend of the</p>
<p>winter season. Matches resume on March 16, 1997.</p>
<p>  AB		1	Aarhus    1</p>
<p>  Brondby	 1	Herfoelge 3</p>
<p>  FC Copenhagen 1	Aalborg   1</p>
